# Build context for `deploy/docker/Dockerfile`.
#
# Keep `migrations/` and `proto/` in the context: the release build embeds the
# migrations and compiles the `.proto` contract at build time.
.git/
.github/
target/
generated/
docs/
icon/
reviews/
test-vectors/
contracts/
openapi/
metaverse_core_specification.md
**/.env
**/*.env.local
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
